<title>USA: L.A. Gear names Victor Trippetti as COO. [CORRECTED 15:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>L.A. Gear names Victor Trippetti as COO. [CORRECTED 15:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>L.A. Gear Inc said it appointed Victor Trippetti as chief financial officer (CFO) (corrects title from chief operating officer (COO)) and senior vice president.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Trippetti will replace William Benford, who has left the company to join Shamrock Capital MacGregor Inc.</p>
<p>Trippetti was vice president and treasurer of the company since July 1992.</p>
